"This is the shared key you define. It has to match the client configuration for your server. It can be as short or as long as you like. It is recommended you follow the same kind of password policies your organization would have for something like a wireless WEP key" => "Ceci est la clé partagée définie. Elle doit correspondre à la configuration client. Utilisez une politique de mot de passe similaire à celle de votre organisation",
"IP" => "I.P.",
"The physical IP address the client machine will be making requests to the server from. If the client is on the same machine, you should be able to use 127.0.0.1" => "Adresse IP physique depuis laquelle le client fera les requêtes vers le serveur. Si le client est sur la même machine, utilisez 127.0.0.1",
"Username of primary contact on client machine. Useful for adminstration" => "Nom d'utilisateur du contact principal sur la machine cliente. Utile pour l'administration",
"Can register" => "Peut s'inscrire",
