// "About %0" => "About %0",
// "To help developers solve the bug, we kindly request that you demonstrate your bug on a %0 instance. To start, simply select a version and click on \"Create %0 instance\". Once the instance is ready (in a minute or two), as indicated in the status window below, you can then access that instance, login (the initial admin username/password is \"admin\") and configure the Tiki to demonstrate your bug. Priority will be given to bugs that have been demonstrated on %0" => "To help developers solve the bug, we kindly request that you demonstrate your bug on a %0 instance. To start, simply select a version and click on \"Create %0 instance\". Once the instance is ready (in a minute or two), as indicated in the status window below, you can then access that instance, login (the initial admin username/password is \"admin\") and configure the Tiki to demonstrate your bug. Priority will be given to bugs that have been demonstrated on %0",
